    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d306">

                <pb facs="0541" n="479" sameAs="frus:frus1878/pg479"/>

                <head>No. 301.<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Evarts to Baron Blanc</hi>.</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1878-01-22"><hi rendition="#italic">January</hi> 22,
                        1878</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have the honor to acknowledge the receipt
                    of your note of the 18th instant relative to the solemn service to be held this
                    morning at <pb facs="0542" n="480" xml:id="pg480"/> the church of Saint Aloysius
                    in memory of King Victor Emanuel, and requesting that the President be informed
                    how highly the legation of Italy would feel honored by his presence at the
                    ceremony.</p>
                <p>I avail myself of this occasion to recur to the unfeigned sorrow of the President
                    and the people of the United States at the occurrence of the mournful event
                    which has rendered memorial services necessary.</p>
                <p>Accept, &amp;c.,</p>
                <closer><signed>WM. M. EVARTS.</signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
